  "ingredients": [
    "nonstick cooking spray",
    "2.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2 cups sugar",
    "2 teaspoons baking soda",
    "0.5 teaspoon baking powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "2 cups persimmon pulp",
    "1 cup milk",
    "2 large eggs",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 300 degrees F (150 degrees C). Spray a 9x13-inch baking pan with nonstick spray and dust with flour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OyDqHrS2NHPIm7YMT0Z7QiXHREU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/163497-persimmon-cake-VAT-step-01-7e3685fe808443878b75c78f19a4442e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/163497/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk together flour, sugar, baking soda, baking powder, and salt in a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/r1RusR7dkZcJlHg81-9Mc5Erwv4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/163497-persimmon-cake-VAT-step-02-3a919dd4586840b78e1c1af0f94dbc35.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/163497/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk persimmon pulp, milk, eggs, and vanilla together in a separate bowl until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OTuA9VacGBOyeQHTVR-JeqxEfmU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/163497-persimmon-cake-VAT-step-03-4f9e0be7bc404e4eb054a404f49b2da0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/163497/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold the persimmon mixture into the flour mixture until no dry lumps remain; pour batter into the prepared pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2hrEbWHWVszHTXGUOAyZbx1Wqow=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/163497-persimmon-cake-VAT-step-04-c0a799878a184c20ad7bc6786185ae04.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/163497/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean, 50 to 75 minutes. Cool in the pan for 10 minutes, then remove from the pan, and allow to cool completely on a wire rack.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
